    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Frank Fleming Estate Agent is delighted to present to the market No.112 Glasnevin Downs. Located just off the Old Finglas Road, Glasnevin Downs was constructed in the late 1980s and is a popular development with young families due to its open spaces, cul-de-sac setting and the abundance of local amenities. The property is very well maintained and comes with the added bonus of a south/west rear garden and off-street parking\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a hallway with guest wc, spacious living room to the front and large kitchen/dining room to the rear. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, two doubles and a single room. A bathroom completes the accommodation. To the front there is off-street parking, while the south/west facing rear garden is laid mainly to lawn with a block-built storage shed. The property also benefits from side pedestrian access.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none with a plethora of amenities within walking distance of the property that include local shops, cafés, bars and restaurants. There is a good selection of primary and secondary schools in the vicinity. Also walking distance to an array of recreational amenities within the immediate area, including Na Fianna, Griffith Park and the Botanic Gardens, to name a few. Dublin Airport is within a 15-minute drive of the property, as is the M50 motorway which provides easy access to the national road network."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall - 15'9\" (4.8m) x 6'0\" (1.83m) \r\nWith timber laminate floor and guest wc\r\n\r\nGuest WC - 2'6\" (0.76m) x 5'4\" (1.63m) \r\nWith wash hand basin and wc\r\n\r\nFamily Room - 12'4\" (3.76m) x 13'4\" (4.06m)\r\nWith timber laminate floor, open fire and TV point\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 15'7\" (4.75m) x 18'1\" (5.51m)\r\nLarge bright room to the rear of the property. The kitchen has an ample array of storage presses, is plumbed for a dishwasher and washing machine and has a large under-stair storage press. Door to rear garden\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 8'9\" (2.67m) x 11'1\" (3.38m)\r\nLocated to the front of the property with built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 9'8\" (2.95m) x 9'11\" (3.02m)\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 6'7\" (2.01m) x 8'0\" (2.44m)\r\nLocated to the front of the property with built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom - 5'9\" (1.75m) x 8'9\" (2.67m)\r\nWith wash hand basin, wc and bath with overhead shower"
      },
      {
